roup  and our subreddit the links for both are  provided in the description of today's  episode  finally please remember that we are not  medical doctors or registered dietitians  so before you make any changes to your  exercise or nutrition habits  be sure to check with a qualified health  care professional  once again thank you for listening and  we will be back soon with another  episode  of the stronger by science podcast  [Music]  [Music]  you
 

